DESCRIPTION:Francesca Fiorentini is a journalist\, podcaster\, and stand u
 p comedian. She has been featured on the podcast Lovett or Leave It\, the B
 BC Arts Hour\, and has been part of SF Sketchfest\, SF Comedy Day\, and the
  Asian-American Comedy Festival in LA. She hosts her very successful week
 ly political comedy podcast The Bitchuation Room\, performs regularly at t
 he Improv and the Ice House\, where she hosts her sold out monthly show\, N
 ew World Disorder\, and tours comedy clubs across the country co-headlining
  with her husband\, Matt Lieb.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium
  seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket
